  "body": "Follow-up to #128. The first slice has `set_stock` (box, cylinder, from model). It cannot set a WCS origin (`SetWcsOrigin`), declare or activate setups, load a machine (`LoadMachine`), or mark fixtures.\n\nWanted: tools for each, every one a command through the session History, with refusals as tool errors. `get_job` already reports the setups, stock and WCS slots.\n\nDone means: an MCP test sets G54 off the stock corner, loads a machine, adds a fixture, and the verifier's fixture findings come back as data.\n",
